 "cues": [
  {
   "t0": 3.15,
   "t1": 5.7,
   "text": "Two best friends. One business.",
   "who": "",
   "line": "n01"
  },
  {
   "t0": 5.79,
   "t1": 7.94,
   "text": "15 years of hard work.",
   "who": "",
   "line": "n01"
  },
  {
   "t0": 8.95,
   "t1": 10.95,
   "text": "Bro, 15 years already.",
   "who": "Daniel",
   "line": "d01"
  },
  {
   "t0": 10.97,
   "t1": 12.88,
   "text": "We really built this from nothing.",
   "who": "Daniel",
   "line": "d01"
  },
  {
   "t0": 12.9,
   "t1": 15.19,
   "text": "Next 15 years, we go bigger.",
   "who": "Aaron",
   "line": "a01"
  },
  {
   "t0": 15.35,
   "t1": 18.14,
   "text": "Then one night, everything changed.",
   "who": "",
   "line": "n02"
  },
  {
   "t0": 19.85,
   "t1": 22.19,
   "text": "Hello, Aaron? I'm calling from the hospital.",
   "who": "Hospital",
   "line": "h01"
  },
  {
   "t0": 22.21,
   "t1": 24.58,
   "text": "I'm very sorry. It's about Daniel.",
   "who": "Hospital",
   "line": "h01"
  },
  {
   "t0": 29.15,
   "t1": 31.7,
   "text": "Aaron, I know Daniel loved this business.",
   "who": "Sarah",
   "line": "s01"
  },
  {
   "t0": 31.73,
   "t1": 33.49,
   "text": "But I don't know how to run it.",
   "who": "Sarah",
   "line": "s01"
  },
  {
   "t0": 33.51,
   "t1": 36.03,
   "text": "The family needs financial security.",
   "who": "Sarah",
   "line": "s01"
  },
  {
   "t0": 36.05,
   "t1": 38.35,
   "text": "Daniel's shares are part of his estate.",
   "who": "Estate representative",
   "line": "e01"
  },
  {
   "t0": 38.37,
   "t1": 39.89,
   "text": "So any transfer follows the legal",
   "who": "Estate representative",
   "line": "e01"
  },
  {
   "t0": 39.91,
   "t1": 42.52,
   "text": "documents and the estate process.",
   "who": "Estate representative",
   "line": "e01"
  },
  {
   "t0": 42.6,
   "t1": 45.06,
   "text": "I understand. I want to buy his shares.",
   "who": "Aaron",
   "line": "a02"
  },
  {
   "t0": 45.08,
   "t1": 47.67,
   "text": "But the company doesn't have that kind of cash.",
   "who": "Aaron",
   "line": "a02"
  },
  {
   "t0": 47.75,
   "t1": 49.45,
   "text": "The business had value.",
   "who": "",
   "line": "n03"
  },
  {
   "t0": 49.47,
   "t1": 51.59,
   "text": "But that didn't mean Aaron had a million",
   "who": "",
   "line": "n03"
  },
  {
   "t0": 51.61,
   "t1": 54.68,
   "text": "dollars ready to buy Daniel's shares.",
   "who": "",
   "line": "n03"
  },
  {
   "t0": 56.65,
   "t1": 59.45,
   "text": "To raise that amount, you may have to borrow heavily,",
   "who": "Accountant",
   "line": "c01"
  },
  {
   "t0": 59.47,
   "t1": 62.44,
   "text": "sell assets, or bring in another investor.",
   "who": "Accountant",
   "line": "c01"
  },
  {
   "t0": 63.75,
   "t1": 65.98,
   "text": "One family needed liquidity.",
   "who": "",
   "line": "n04"
  },
  {
   "t0": 66.19,
   "t1": 68.8,
   "text": "One founder needed business continuity.",
   "who": "",
   "line": "n04"
  },
  {
   "t0": 69.05,
   "t1": 70.79,
   "text": "Neither wanted a dispute.",
   "who": "",
   "line": "n04"
  },
  {
   "t0": 70.81,
   "t1": 73.38,
   "text": "But there was no funded exit plan.",
   "who": "",
   "line": "n04"
  },
  {
   "t0": 79.95,
   "t1": 82.53,
   "text": "Let's do this properly, while we can.",
   "who": "Daniel",
   "line": "d02"
  },
  {
   "t0": 82.55,
   "t1": 85.1,
   "text": "The agreement establishes the path.",
   "who": "",
   "line": "n05"
  },
  {
   "t0": 85.13,
   "t1": 87.85,
   "text": "Insurance can help provide the money.",
   "who": "",
   "line": "n05"
  },
  {
   "t0": 87.87,
   "t1": 89.69,
   "text": "Together, they can turn a difficult",
   "who": "",
   "line": "n05"
  },
  {
   "t0": 89.71,
   "t1": 93.18,
   "text": "ownership transition into a planned one.",
   "who": "",
   "line": "n05"
  },
  {
   "t0": 100.85,
   "t1": 102.13,
   "text": "Thank you, Aaron.",
   "who": "Sarah",
   "line": "s02"
  },
  {
   "t0": 102.15,
   "t1": 103.63,
   "text": "Daniel was gone.",
   "who": "",
   "line": "n06"
  },
  {
   "t0": 103.65,
   "t1": 107.56,
   "text": "But the future he helped build didn't have to fall apart.",
   "who": "",
   "line": "n06"
  }
 ],
